title: Nutanix Prism: VM Network (API v4)
agents: nutanix
catalog: virtual/nutanix
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check shows the network throughput (in/out) and the dropped packets
 of a Nutanix VM as measured by the hypervisor. The values are calculated
 from the counters of the last sampling interval (about 30 seconds).

 The check is always OK, it is meant for graphing the network usage.

 This check requires the Nutanix Prism special agent for API v4 (agent_prism_v4).

discovery:
 One service is created for every VM.
